# Ordinary Haxe compile of the classifier fixture (source acceptance).
# It type-checks the fixture declarations through the full typer. No macro,
# no --interp, no Sys.exit, so a type error in the fixture fails this
# command. run.sh supplies the -js output argument under a
# fresh per-invocation evidence directory, so no build artifact is fixed to
# a shared path. The command's streams and status are captured by run.sh.
# Run through the pinned toolchain:
#   nix develop -c bash tests/haxe/classifier/run.sh
-cp samples
-cp tests/haxe/classifier
-main classifier.CompileEntry
